      309.94,
      472.07
    ],
    "text": "I hereby inform that the Government intends to acquire thedependence of the following land for the purpose of buildingthe proposed Grid Sub Station in Ragala under TransmissionDevelopment Project for obtaining Sustainable Energy underSub Section (1) of Section 7 of the Act.",
