      509.52,
      310.03,
      567.59
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 01 (Surveyor General Plan No. PPN 3221)Name of land: Rahathungoda Watta; Description: Teaplantation with plants about 25 year's old; Claimant: JanathaEstate Dev Board No. 55/75, Vauxhall Lane, Colombo 2; Extent:1.6187 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
